  {
   "id": "the-legend-of-heroes-trails-to-azure-23323@1.1.10",
   "gameId": "the-legend-of-heroes-trails-to-azure-23323",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.10",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2023-03-18T09:57:26.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "in today's patch for Trails to Azure, we have included the following fixes and improvements:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a potential crash when advancing the Master Quartz level-up window too quickly.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed some instances where achievements would not be unlocked correctly after importing data from another release of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Minor 3D geometry fixes in a few maps.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Tweaked the battle UI placement of the HP/EP/CP labels.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Implemented a workaround for loading Trails from Zero clear saves when in a WINE environment with separate prefixes (such as on the Steam Deck). For standard cases, it should now \"just work\", as long as you also have Trails from Zero installed on the same device, and started it at least once to make sure the saves are synchronized.: [expand type=details]Specifically, this now works if all individual Steam game prefixes are in the same root, which is the default Proton configuration. If you have multiple custom WINE prefixes you will still have to do a manual copy or symlink.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "As always for our releases, in case you experience any regressions you can revert to prior versions of the game using the Steam \"Beta\" feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Peter \"Durante\" Thoman",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
